ind":"announcement","title":"UI & Presentation Improvements","summary":"Revenggie's interface has received a visual overhaul focused on clarity, organization, and overall presentation.Menus, rewards, QTEs, and gameplay information have been reorganized with a cleaner and more consistent UI style, making important information easier to read while preserving the game's visual identity.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T19:01:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696196","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5011680-1842212951295797","game_id":"steam-5011680","kind":"announcement","title":"Performance Improvements","summary":"Improved performance across the game's environments, particularly on lower-end hardware.The result is a smoother experience with no significant changes to the game's visual quality.Thanks again to everyone who tested the demo and shared feedbacks!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T04:57:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951295797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5011680-1840310314345351","game_id":"steam-5011680","kind":"update","title":"Revenggie Demo - Final Polish & Community Feedback Update","summary":"Hey everyone!The first days after launching the Revenggie demo have been incredibly exciting.I've already received feedback from players, friends, and even a few people who discovered the game completely on their own. Every message has helped me look at Revenggie from a different perspective and identify things that I could improve.So, before moving forward with the full game, I decided to take one final step back and give the demo a proper polish pass based on the feedback I've received.This up","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-07T15:26:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314345351","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5011680-1839676055897987","game_id":"steam-5011680","kind":"announcement","title":"Revenggie Demo is now available!","summary":"Hello, Revenggers! 🥕 We've been working hard over the past few months, and we're excited to finally let everyone experience the first public version of Revenggie, now available on Steam!This first version includes:• Partial controller support (everything is fully playable except the HUB)• Improved menus, animations, UI, and overall UX• Individual volume controls• Inverted vertical camera option• Save game improvements (collected Seeds are now properly saved after quitting)• Various bug fixes and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T17:18:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055897987","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:18:46Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5011680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5011680":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5011680":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z"},"5017930":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:14:15Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5011680"